    truth): each SVG path and gradient maps one to one, in the same order. The gradients use
    absolute mapping because the SVG declares them in user space, and F1 keeps the SVG's
    nonzero fill rule. Assets/Sortify.ico is rendered from this drawing for the exe, the
    taskbar and Alt+Tab.
